## 🏗️ Proposed Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    ATTENDANCE SYSTEM v2                         │
├─────────────────┬───────────────────┬───────────────────────────┤
│  OWNER PORTAL   │  TRAINER PORTAL   │    MEMBER PORTAL          │
│  /attendance    │  /trainer/members │    /member/my-attendance  │
│                 │  /attendance      │                           │
│  Full analytics │  My members list  │    Personal history       │
│  Manual check-in│  Attendance badge │    Streak counter         │
│  Export reports │  Session insights │    Monthly calendar       │
│  Floor live view│                   │    Visit frequency        │
└────────┬────────┴────────┬──────────┴────────┬──────────────────┘
         │                 │                    │
         ▼                 ▼                    ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│               AttendanceController (role-split endpoints)        │
│  OWNER/ADMIN: full read/write + bulk export                      │
│  TRAINER:     read-only for assigned members                     │
│  MEMBER:      read-only own history + self check-in             │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│               AttendanceService (new — extracted logic)          │
│  - validateAndCheckIn()  (duplicate prevention)                  │
│  - checkOut()                                                    │
│  - computeStreak(userId)                                         │
│  - getHistoryPaginated()                                         │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│               CheckIn Model + CheckInRepository                  │
│  + checkInMethod field    + gym-scoped queries                   │
│  + notes field            + duplicate-check query                │
│                           + pagination support                   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

