## 📋 Implementation Plan — Phase by Phase

---

### PHASE 1 — Database & Model Fixes (Foundation)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> All other phases depend on this. Must go first.

#### [MODIFY] `CheckIn.java`
- Add `checkInMethod` field → Enum: `MANUAL`, `QR`, `SELF`, `CLASS`
- Add `notes` String field (optional admin notes)
- Remove ambiguous status strings → use Enum: `ACTIVE`, `CHECKED_OUT`
- Fix the conflicting `gymId` column mapping (currently has both `@Column(gym_id)` AND `@ManyToOne(gym_id)`)

#### [NEW] `CheckInMethod.java` enum
- Values: `MANUAL` (staff did it), `SELF` (member used app), `QR` (scanned code), `CLASS` (booked class)

#### [MODIFY] `CheckInRepository.java`
Add these queries:
```java
findActiveCheckInByUserId(Long userId)           // is user currently inside?
countByUserIdAndDate(Long userId, LocalDate date) // duplicate prevention
findByGymIdAndCheckInTimeBetween(gymId, start, end, Pageable) // paginated
findByUserUserIdAndCheckInTimeBetween(userId, start, end)     // member history
```

#### DB Migration Script (Oracle)
```sql
ALTER TABLE CHECK_INS ADD check_in_method VARCHAR2(20) DEFAULT 'MANUAL';
ALTER TABLE CHECK_INS ADD notes VARCHAR2(500);
```

---

### PHASE 2 — Service Layer (Extract Business Logic)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Currently all logic is crammed into the controller. Extract to a service.

#### [NEW] `AttendanceService.java`
Key methods:
- `validateAndCheckIn(userId, gymId, method)` → prevents double check-in, returns `CheckIn`
- `checkOut(checkInId, userId)` → validates ownership before checkout
- `getTodayAttendance(gymId, role, pageRequest)` → gym-scoped, paginated
- `getStats(gymId, role)` → **NO FAKE DATA** — returns real zeros if no data exists
- `getTrends(gymId, from, to, role)` → real data only
- `getHeatmap(gymId, weeks, role)` → real data only
- `getMemberHistory(userId, from, to)` → member's own records
- `getTrainerMembersAttendance(trainerId, from, to)` → assigned members only
- `computeStreak(userId)` → consecutive days visited

---

### PHASE 3 — Controller Refactor

#### [MODIFY] `AttendanceController.java`

**Remove:**
- All `simulateAttendance()` and `simulateHourlyAttendance()` methods
- All fallback simulation logic from stats/trends/heatmap

**Add/Fix:**

```java
// OWNER/ADMIN endpoints (existing - fix gym scoping)
GET  /api/attendance/today         → gymId filtered, paginated
GET  /api/attendance/live          → gymId filtered
GET  /api/attendance/stats         → real data only
GET  /api/attendance/trends        → real data only
GET  /api/attendance/heatmap       → real data only
POST /api/attendance/check-in      → validateAndCheckIn() call
PUT  /api/attendance/check-out/{id}→ with ownership validation

// NEW TRAINER endpoints
GET  /api/attendance/trainer/members → @PreAuthorize TRAINER
     Returns attendance for trainer's assigned members

// NEW MEMBER endpoints  
GET  /api/attendance/me/history    → @PreAuthorize MEMBER
     Returns only that member's own history
POST /api/attendance/me/check-in   → @PreAuthorize MEMBER
     Self check-in with method=SELF
GET  /api/attendance/me/streak     → returns currentStreak, longestStreak
```

---

### PHASE 4 — Frontend Service Update

#### [MODIFY] `attendanceTaskApi.ts`
- Fix `checkIn()` to call `/api/attendance/check-in` (not `/dashboard/check-in/{id}`)
- Fix `checkOut()` to call `/api/attendance/check-out/{id}` (not `/dashboard/check-out/{id}`)
- Add `selfCheckIn()` → POST `/api/attendance/me/check-in`
- Add `getMyHistory(from, to)` → GET `/api/attendance/me/history`
- Add `getMyStreak()` → GET `/api/attendance/me/streak`
- Add `getTrainerMembersAttendance(from, to)` → GET `/api/attendance/trainer/members`
- Add proper TypeScript types: `AttendanceStreak`, `MemberAttendanceSummary`, `TrainerMemberAttendance`

---

### PHASE 5 — Owner Portal UI Improvements

#### [MODIFY] `Attendance.tsx` + `Attendance.css`

**Logic fixes:**
- Remove frontend-only fallback simulation assumptions
- Replace hardcoded `peakCapacity: 120/30` with real gym setting
- Add date-range custom picker (not just 7D/14D/30D/90D tabs)
- Server-side pagination (add `page`, `size` params to API call)
- Show a clear "No data yet" state instead of zeros/N/A when DB is empty

**UI improvements:**
- **Live Floor Panel**: Real-time live count with user avatars in a sticky side panel
- **Date Range Picker**: Custom `from` / `to` date picker replacing period tabs
- **Export enhancement**: Export by custom date range, not just today
- **Retention Rate KPI**: New card showing % of members who came back this week vs last
- **Busiest Hour callout**: Highlight the peak hour from heatmap in a stat badge
- **Empty state redesign**: When no data, show onboarding tip instead of blank zeros

---

### PHASE 6 — Member Portal: "My Attendance" Page

#### [NEW] `/frontend/src/pages/member/MyAttendance.tsx`
#### [NEW] `/frontend/src/pages/member/MyAttendance.css`

**Sections:**
1. **Streak Banner** — Current streak 🔥, Longest streak, Total visits this month
2. **Monthly Calendar** — Heatmap-style calendar showing which days they visited (green = visited, red = missed, gray = future)
3. **Recent Visits Table** — Date, check-in time, check-out time, session duration
4. **Frequency Chart** — Bar chart: visits per week for last 12 weeks
5. **Self Check-In Button** — If member doesn't have a check-in today, show a prominent "Check In Now" button

**Backend dependency:** Phase 3 member endpoints

---

### PHASE 7 — Trainer Portal: Member Attendance View

#### [NEW] `/frontend/src/pages/trainer/MemberAttendance.tsx`
#### [NEW] `/frontend/src/pages/trainer/MemberAttendance.css`

**Sections:**
1. **My Members List** — Cards showing each assigned member with:
   - Last visit date (color-coded: green <3 days, yellow 3–7 days, red >7 days)
   - This month visit count
   - Current streak
   - "Absent Alert" badge if not seen in 7+ days
2. **Member Detail Drill-down** — Click a member → see their attendance calendar for the last 30 days
3. **Attendance Summary** — Which of my members are inside the gym right now (live)

**Backend dependency:** Phase 3 trainer endpoints

---

### PHASE 8 — Routing & Navigation

#### [MODIFY] `App.tsx`
- Add route: `/member/my-attendance` → `<MyAttendance />`
- No new trainer route needed if added to existing `MyMembers` page as a tab

#### [MODIFY] Member Sidebar Navigation
- Add "My Attendance" nav item with `Calendar` icon

#### [MODIFY] Trainer Sidebar Navigation
- Add "Member Attendance" tab inside `MyMembers` page

