### Backend
```bash
# After Phase 1-3:
curl -X POST /api/attendance/check-in -d '{"userId": 1}'   # should check in
curl -X POST /api/attendance/check-in -d '{"userId": 1}'   # should return 409 CONFLICT
curl -X PUT  /api/attendance/check-out/1                   # should check out
curl        /api/attendance/stats                           # should return real zeros if empty
curl        /api/attendance/me/history  # with MEMBER JWT  # should return only own records
